</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Depress brake pedal and push engine switch and perform engine cranking.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is engine cranking?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Intermittent trouble. (condition of keyless engine start function is not concluded)
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 4.
</ptxt>
</action>
