<ptxt>
Perform “Immobilizer Key Registration”. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AA306002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Start engine.
